"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/pau-koh"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"definicin-breve\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Definición breve</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Una </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>blockchain</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> (cadena de bloques) es una base de datos digital que se distribuye entre múltiples computadoras (nodos) y que registra información de forma segura, transparente e inalterable.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Cada bloque contiene datos (como transacciones) y está vinculado al bloque anterior mediante un código criptográfico, formando así una cadena.</span></p></div><div id=\"cmo-funciona-una-blockchain\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Cómo funciona una blockchain?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">A continuación, se detalla el funcionamiento básico de una blockchain pública:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-imageBlock _2fealp0\" style=\"--caption-alignment:left\"><div class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/f393306b-0f85-4c7c-81d9-af99b16993f1/ChatGPT_Image_23_abr_2025__14_09_32.png?t=1745431787 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/f393306b-0f85-4c7c-81d9-af99b16993f1/ChatGPT_Image_23_abr_2025__14_09_32.png?t=1745431787 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/f393306b-0f85-4c7c-81d9-af99b16993f1/ChatGPT_Image_23_abr_2025__14_09_32.png?t=1745431787 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=430,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/f393306b-0f85-4c7c-81d9-af99b16993f1/ChatGPT_Image_23_abr_2025__14_09_32.png?t=1745431787 1x\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/f393306b-0f85-4c7c-81d9-af99b16993f1/ChatGPT_Image_23_abr_2025__14_09_32.png?t=1745431787\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1536\" style=\"width:45%;border-radius:0px;aspect-ratio:1024 / 1536;height:auto\" class=\"_2fealp2 _2fealp5\"></picture></div></div><div id=\"componentes-clave-de-una-blockchain\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Componentes clave de una blockchain</span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-imageBlock _2fealp0\" style=\"--caption-alignment:center\"><div class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/5f932274-0800-419a-af1c-370bf5c3f614/_336A2CBB-5313-4F03-923B-6AF2FA0D30A3_.png?t=1745432243 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/5f932274-0800-419a-af1c-370bf5c3f614/_336A2CBB-5313-4F03-923B-6AF2FA0D30A3_.png?t=1745432243 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/5f932274-0800-419a-af1c-370bf5c3f614/_336A2CBB-5313-4F03-923B-6AF2FA0D30A3_.png?t=1745432243 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=430,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/5f932274-0800-419a-af1c-370bf5c3f614/_336A2CBB-5313-4F03-923B-6AF2FA0D30A3_.png?t=1745432243 1x\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/5f932274-0800-419a-af1c-370bf5c3f614/_336A2CBB-5313-4F03-923B-6AF2FA0D30A3_.png?t=1745432243\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"644\" height=\"188\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:0px;aspect-ratio:644 / 188;height:auto\" class=\"_2fealp2 _2fealp5\"></picture></div></div><div id=\"qu-tipos-de-blockchain-existen\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Qué tipos de blockchain existen?</span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-imageBlock _2fealp0\" style=\"--caption-alignment:center\"><div class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/a3b4999a-ccf0-4548-8674-901a1c571b4f/_54F044F2-6B72-47D3-87E2-D31319516C5A_.png?t=1745432283 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/a3b4999a-ccf0-4548-8674-901a1c571b4f/_54F044F2-6B72-47D3-87E2-D31319516C5A_.png?t=1745432283 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/a3b4999a-ccf0-4548-8674-901a1c571b4f/_54F044F2-6B72-47D3-87E2-D31319516C5A_.png?t=1745432283 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=430,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/a3b4999a-ccf0-4548-8674-901a1c571b4f/_54F044F2-6B72-47D3-87E2-D31319516C5A_.png?t=1745432283 1x\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/a3b4999a-ccf0-4548-8674-901a1c571b4f/_54F044F2-6B72-47D3-87E2-D31319516C5A_.png?t=1745432283\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:0px;aspect-ratio:599 / 123;height:auto\" class=\"_2fealp2 _2fealp5\"></picture></div></div><div id=\"ventajas-de-la-blockchain\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ventajas de la blockchain</span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Transparencia</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Todos los participantes pueden ver las transacciones.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Inmutabilidad</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Una vez registrada, la información no puede ser modificada sin consenso.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Descentralización</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: No depende de una sola entidad.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Seguridad</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Usa criptografía avanzada para proteger los datos.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"usos-actuales-de-la-blockchain\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Usos actuales de la blockchain</span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Criptomonedas</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Como Bitcoin o Stellar Lumens (XLM), que permiten transferencias sin intermediarios.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Contratos inteligentes</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Programas que se ejecutan automáticamente al cumplirse ciertas condiciones.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Certificados digitales</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Como títulos universitarios o registros de propiedad.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Votación electrónica</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Sistemas más seguros y auditables.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Remesas internacionales</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Transferencias más rápidas y económicas que con bancos tradicionales.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"desafos-y-limitaciones\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Desafíos y limitaciones</span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Escalabilidad</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Algunas blockchains tienen dificultades para procesar muchas transacciones al mismo tiempo.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Energía</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Redes como Bitcoin consumen grandes cantidades de electricidad.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Regulación</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Los marcos legales aún están en desarrollo en muchos países.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Accesibilidad</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Requiere conocimientos técnicos básicos para su uso seguro.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"recordar\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Recordar</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Blockchain es una tecnología que permite almacenar y compartir información de forma segura, sin necesidad de intermediarios. Aunque nació con las criptomonedas, su potencial va mucho más allá, con aplicaciones en finanzas, logística, salud y más. A medida que evoluciona, también lo hace nuestra comprensión sobre las formas de organizarnos digitalmente.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/2SHteza5dJ\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¡Únete al servidor de Discord Tellus Cooperative!</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Echa un vistazo a la comunidad Tellus Cooperative en Discord. Pasa el rato con 106 miembros y disfruta de chat de voz y texto gratis.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">discord.gg/2SHteza5dJ</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/splashes/871845192058146906/969229c90c917d6b7cc7d7ba70379861.jpg?size=512\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/GURXILGTaOMLCVfKgUHnNc\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse